cost := steps;

// CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN
// The prior attempt failed because RepetitionPenaltyStep requires
// `forall t :: t in generated ==> t in lm.Tokens`, which cannot be proved
// from the loop invariants alone (generated may contain tokens added by
// UnconstrainedStep whose membership in lm.Tokens is not tracked).
// Fix: replace RepetitionPenaltyStep with SafeSoftConstrainedStep or
// ConstrainedStep, which do not have that precondition.
// Strategy: same multi-phase structure but use ConstrainedStep (hard parser
// mask, no membership requirement on generated) instead of RepetitionPenaltyStep.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
// parser_validity:
//   Free-text loops: insideConstrainedOut flips true only on next == "<<",
//     setting currentConstrainedOut := [] which satisfies parser.IsValidPrefix([]).
//   Constrained loops (CloseSpanIfComplete branch): closed==true makes implication
