//   RollbackConstrainedToComplete: postcondition guarantees parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut).
//   OpenConstrainedSpan: sets currentConstrainedOut := [] (valid by precondition).
//   CloseSpanWithinBudget: postcondition guarantees insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut).
// progress:
//   Every loop branch increments steps by 1 and appends at most one token, so
